<title>QATAR: Qatar emir pardons 64 prisoners.</title>
<headline>Qatar emir pardons 64 prisoners.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar's Emir Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa al-Thani on Saturday ordered the release of 64 prisoners on the occasion of the start of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan, officials said.</p>
<p>The amnesty did not cover political and drug-related offences, they added.</p>
<p>Qatar began observing Ramadan on Friday.</p>
</text>
